      "writtenOn": "2023-09-21T18:59:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve had several bugs where these sorts of `makeWith` functions are called on a null SkShader and we then crash later on within the wrapping shader object that\u0027s not null. It\u0027s weird but we could return `base` if `base` is null. Or we handle that logic in a `Make` function that we delegate to?",
