        "id": 5631
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-09-21T19:27:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm. Yeah, that is unfortunate. I feel like if we want to make that change, we ought to do it to all of these? (eg, makeWithColorFilter, directly above, as well)? Perhaps in a follow-up?\n\nActually - I\u0027m just going to put an assert in here, so we at least trigger the failure up front.",
